   "id": 632278,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"5\">\n  <li>The distance a person walks, <span data-math=\"d\">d</span>, in kilometers, is a function of time, <span data-math=\"t\">t</span>, in minutes, since the walk began.<br><br> Select the <strong>two statements</strong> about the input variable of this function that are true.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li>Distance is the input.</li>\n  <li>Time of day is the input.</li>\n  <li>Time since the person starts walking is the input.</li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"t\">t</span> represents the input.</li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"d\">d</span> represents the input.</li>\n  <li>The input is not measured in any particular unit.</li>\n  <li>The input is measured in hours.</li>\n  <li>For each input, there are sometimes two outputs.</li>\n</ol>",
